WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
Turn a rosbag2 recording into a verified Autoware-compatible map bundle with one guided workflow.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.100
Use the read-only doctor, then run the fixed demo. Failures return a stable reason and a safe next action.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.650
For your own bag, the same command checks topics, frames, timing, and calibration before mapping starts.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.667
A successful run retains map verify PASS, a matching validation receipt, and exact next commands for review or recovery.
